    "detailed_description": "<h1>Community</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Paint Chips is an online 2D multiplayer top-down shooter where you splatter your foes with paint! Unlock character customization options as you play and choose a look that suits your style. You can go solo or group up with your friends and paint it up together!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554400/extras/899578d2ad3c2596ac41a8d888f0971a.poster.avif?t=1750961994\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554400/extras/899578d2ad3c2596ac41a8d888f0971a.apng?t=1750961994\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Up to 8-16 players can battle it out across various unique maps and gametypes.<br></li><li>300+ character customization options to give you a unique look!<br></li><li>Earn Chips as you play, spend them on your favorite items in the shop!<br></li><li>Complete daily and weekly challenges that award you with extra Chips.<br></li><li>Host custom private matches with your friends, or test your skill against some bots!<br></li><li>Vote for your favorite map and gametype before a match begins.<br></li><li>Fight for the top spot on the weekly leaderboard!<br></li><li>4 PvP Playlists that change how teams are set up:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>FFA - No teams<br></li><li>Team - 4 vs 4 battles<br></li><li>Doubles - 2 vs 2 vs 2 vs 2 battles<br></li><li>Big Team - 8 vs 8 battles</li></ul></li><li>6 gametypes to change the way each match plays out:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Paintmatch - Regular painting and chipping<br></li><li>Shockets - Everyone spawns with rocket launchers and shotguns<br></li><li>Swipers - Everyone spawns with swords and snipers<br></li><li>Sprinkbows - Everyone spawns with sprinklers and paintbows<br></li><li>Blasterfight - Everyone spawns with blasters<br></li><li>Mystery - Everyone spawns with random weapons</li></ul></li><li>Fight multiple waves of monsters and bosses in the Chippingrounds co-op playlist</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Paint Chips is an online 2D multiplayer top-down shooter where you splatter your foes with paint! Unlock character customization options as you play and choose a look that suits your style. You can go solo or group up with your friends and paint it up together!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554400/extras/899578d2ad3c2596ac41a8d888f0971a.poster.avif?t=1750961994\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554400/extras/899578d2ad3c2596ac41a8d888f0971a.apng?t=1750961994\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Up to 8-16 players can battle it out across various unique maps and gametypes.<br></li><li>300+ character customization options to give you a unique look!<br></li><li>Earn Chips as you play, spend them on your favorite items in the shop!<br></li><li>Complete daily and weekly challenges that award you with extra Chips.<br></li><li>Host custom private matches with your friends, or test your skill against some bots!<br></li><li>Vote for your favorite map and gametype before a match begins.<br></li><li>Fight for the top spot on the weekly leaderboard!<br></li><li>4 PvP Playlists that change how teams are set up:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>FFA - No teams<br></li><li>Team - 4 vs 4 battles<br></li><li>Doubles - 2 vs 2 vs 2 vs 2 battles<br></li><li>Big Team - 8 vs 8 battles</li></ul></li><li>6 gametypes to change the way each match plays out:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Paintmatch - Regular painting and chipping<br></li><li>Shockets - Everyone spawns with rocket launchers and shotguns<br></li><li>Swipers - Everyone spawns with swords and snipers<br></li><li>Sprinkbows - Everyone spawns with sprinklers and paintbows<br></li><li>Blasterfight - Everyone spawns with blasters<br></li><li>Mystery - Everyone spawns with random weapons</li></ul></li><li>Fight multiple waves of monsters and bosses in the Chippingrounds co-op playlist</li></ul>",
